  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "As you know, Pick-Up on VRChat requires fine control of posture. This is where PlaySpaceMover comes in handy. However, this software can only be used in SteamVR with Addon, and for users of the Oculus Rift, Quest, and Rift S, running SteamVR alongside Oculus' software can cause a load, which is not desirable. So I would suggest adding something similar to PlaySpaceMover as an official feature of VRChat.\nIt would be desirable to have a key configuration from Settings to switch usage and use the feature.\nThis text has been translated from Japanese to English by the following software and the translation may be inaccurate.\nTranslated with www.DeepL.com/Translator (free version)",
